x items-start gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-rose-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span><span>Tourist visa fees &amp; mandatory medical insurance</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-rose-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span><span>Personal expenses, laundry, and minibar charges</span></li><li class="flex items-start gap-2"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-sm text-rose-500 shrink-0 mt-0.5">close</span><span>Meals not specified in the confirmed inclusions list</span></li></ul></div></div></section><div class="space-y-12"><section class="bg-surface-container-lowest p-6 sm:p-8 rounded-3xl border border-surface-container-high/80 shadow-xs"><div class="flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-center justify-between gap-4 mb-8 pb-6 border-b border-surface-container-high"><div><div class="flex items-center gap-2 mb-1"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-secondary text-xl">tune</span><span class="font-sans text-xs font-bold text-secondary uppercase tracking-widest">Interactive Itinerary Scrubber</span></div><h3 class="font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-primary">Personalise Stays &amp; Daily Pacing</h3><p class="font-sans text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Tweak your accommodation tier and day activities. The benchmark price updates transparently in real time.</p></div></div><div class="mb-8 p-4 rounded-2xl bg-amber-50/80 border border-amber-200/90 flex items-start gap-3 text-xs text-amber-950"><span class="material-symbols-outlined text-amber-700 text-lg shrink-0 mt-0.5">edit_calendar</span><div><strong class="font-semibold block mb-0.5 text-amber-900">Suggested Itinerary Blueprint</strong><span>This day-by-day outline is an indicative planning route. Specific inclusions, hotel properties, and private transfers are fully customized with your dedicated Jeto consultant before confirmation.</span></div></div><div class="mb-8"><label class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracki