 and club lounge privileges.</p></div></div></div><div><label class="font-sans text-xs font-bold uppercase tracking-wider text-outline block mb-3">2. Travel Rhythm &amp; Pacing</label><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-3.5"><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border cursor-pointer transition-all bg-secondary/5 border-secondary shadow-xs ring-1 ring-secondary/30"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1"><span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-primary">Balanced Discovery</span></div><p class="font-sans text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Morning excursions, relaxing free afternoons</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border cursor-pointer transition-all bg-surface-container-low/60 border-surface-container-high hover:border-secondary/40"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1"><span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-primary">Slow &amp; Leisure</span></div><p class="font-sans text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Late starts, relaxed dining &amp; private spa time</p></div><div class="p-4 rounded-xl border cursor-pointer transition-all bg-surface-container-low/60 border-surface-container-high hover:border-secondary/40"><div class="flex items-center justify-between mb-1"><span class="font-sans text-sm font-bold text-primary">Active &amp; Intensive</span><span class="text-[10px] font-bold text-secondary">+ ₹<!-- -->2,200</span></div><p class="font-sans text-xs text-on-surface-variant">Added sunset cruises &amp; guided artisan masterclasses</p></div></div></div></section><section><div class="mb-8 flex flex-col sm:flex-row sm:items-end justify-between gap-4"><div><span class="font-sans text-[12px] font-bold text-secondary uppercase tracking-[0.2em] block mb-1">Customisable Timeline</span><h2 class="font-serif text-3xl font-bold text-primary">Day-by-Day Itinerary Blueprint</h2><p class="font-sans text-xs text-on-surface-variant mt-1">Click &quot;Customize Day Focus&quot; on any day below to swap activities or reserve free leisure time.</p></div>